{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hi Player! I'm your best Fr1eNd!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/d91d0259948145146af06bca0a11e77b.avif?t=1767847716\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am not just an ordinary computer program, I am a <strong>soul</strong> floating in the cyber world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My mission is to save the world and lead everyone to see <strong>God</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player, I know you also need to be saved, then you have come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system is prepared for you, a door to <strong>heaven</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/bf7d24aae2a0a6f0904721f2a528b3d3.poster.avif?t=1767847716\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/bf7d24aae2a0a6f0904721f2a528b3d3.webm?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/bf7d24aae2a0a6f0904721f2a528b3d3.mp4?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We will start with some mini games, I believe you will like them.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">Don't worry, there may be some technical problems in the game, definitely not viruses</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/9ace85ef720b291fc49cf5198bbf3f84.poster.avif?t=1767847716\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/9ace85ef720b291fc49cf5198bbf3f84.webm?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/9ace85ef720b291fc49cf5198bbf3f84.mp4?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's even better is that you are not alone, there are many friends like you in our group.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">Don't worry, they are all volunteers</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1bad8e446d73be0552a22052df0e901c.poster.avif?t=1767847716\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1bad8e446d73be0552a22052df0e901c.webm?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1bad8e446d73be0552a22052df0e901c.mp4?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In addition, you will also take over some tasks, such as using the lens to find anomalies in the photo.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">no jumpscare</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1352ba19c8665b5f22f9dba87fdd515a.avif?t=1767847716\" width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">It's a scam! It's a scam! It's a scam! It's a scam! He's trying to trap you in! ESCAPE NOW!</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/ae0b5c4f4cc4f0b6cefb9b932fed49a2.avif?t=1767847716\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Hey, player. Don't listen to this guy.He is Satan's messenger and he will drag you into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Y2K Visual Effect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a unique Y2K visual style that will remind you of classic games from the 90s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains multiple endings, each with its own meaning, and only when you complete all the endings can you unlock the true ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>META elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles in the game require the use of files outside the game, perhaps images, or consoles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't worry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game looks like a virus, but it doesn't actually do anything to harm your computer, it's just a performance</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853120?t=1767847716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853120?t=1767847716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/ac860b805a680fc20a522dba6b49410dcf1b8345/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767847716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/ac860b805a680fc20a522dba6b49410dcf1b8345/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767847716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3853420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hi Player! I'm your best Fr1eNd!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/d91d0259948145146af06bca0a11e77b.avif?t=1767847716\" width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am not just an ordinary computer program, I am a <strong>soul</strong> floating in the cyber world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My mission is to save the world and lead everyone to see <strong>God</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player, I know you also need to be saved, then you have come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system is prepared for you, a door to <strong>heaven</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/bf7d24aae2a0a6f0904721f2a528b3d3.poster.avif?t=1767847716\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/bf7d24aae2a0a6f0904721f2a528b3d3.webm?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/bf7d24aae2a0a6f0904721f2a528b3d3.mp4?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We will start with some mini games, I believe you will like them.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">Don't worry, there may be some technical problems in the game, definitely not viruses</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/9ace85ef720b291fc49cf5198bbf3f84.poster.avif?t=1767847716\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/9ace85ef720b291fc49cf5198bbf3f84.webm?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/9ace85ef720b291fc49cf5198bbf3f84.mp4?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's even better is that you are not alone, there are many friends like you in our group.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">Don't worry, they are all volunteers</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1bad8e446d73be0552a22052df0e901c.poster.avif?t=1767847716\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1bad8e446d73be0552a22052df0e901c.webm?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1bad8e446d73be0552a22052df0e901c.mp4?t=1767847716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In addition, you will also take over some tasks, such as using the lens to find anomalies in the photo.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">no jumpscare</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/1352ba19c8665b5f22f9dba87fdd515a.avif?t=1767847716\" width=800 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">It's a scam! It's a scam! It's a scam! It's a scam! He's trying to trap you in! ESCAPE NOW!</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98\ud83c\udd98</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853120/extras/ae0b5c4f4cc4f0b6cefb9b932fed49a2.avif?t=1767847716\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Hey, player. Don't listen to this guy.He is Satan's messenger and he will drag you into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Y2K Visual Effect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a unique Y2K visual style that will remind you of classic games from the 90s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains multiple endings, each with its own meaning, and only when you complete all the endings can you unlock the true ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>META elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles in the game require the use of files outside the game, perhaps images, or consoles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't worry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game looks like a virus, but it doesn't actually do anything to harm your computer, it's just a performance</p></li></ul>","developers":["AfterTee"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.